# Confusion in the Ranks: the only permanent human's opponent controls is a
# land, which shares no card type with Grizzly Bears. TargetsWithSharedCardType$
# leaves no legal target, so the trigger is not put on the stack and nothing
# is exchanged (no target is queued; one would fail the run).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 4
resolvestack
